**Driver receives offer (WebSocket):**

```json
{"type":"OFFER","trip_id":"trp_7Z3kY8","pickup":{...},"dropoff":{...},
 "estimated_pay_cents":1100,"distance_km":3.2,"expires_in_sec":15}
```

Driver responds within 15 seconds:

```json
{"type":"OFFER_RESPONSE","trip_id":"trp_7Z3kY8","action":"ACCEPT"}
```

If not accepted in time, the offer expires and the matcher offers it to the next candidate.

